  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[`blob/88c7d93d0f87e19beadead68f8d2eb28c503a8a8/source#L56`](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/whatwg/html/88c7d93d0f87e19beadead68f8d2eb28c503a8a8/source#line56:~:text=%3Chgroup%20w-nodev%3E-,%3Ch1%20class=%22allcaps%22%3EHTML%3C/h1%3E,-%3Cp%20w-nosnap%20w-noreview) [^1] contains:\n\n[^1]: [`bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1964509#a1377_691781`](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1964509#a1377_691781:~:text=For%20/plain%2C%20visit%20https://raw.githubusercontent.com/whatwg/html/88c7d93d0f87e19beadead68f8d2eb28c503a8a8/source%23line500.&text=Line%20numbers%20should%20appear.,scrolled%20to%20the%20relevant%20line.&text=for%20%60text/HTML%60\\).%20%E2%86%92-,%60view%2Dsource:%60%20solely%20renders%20line%20numbers%20for%20%60text/HTML%60%2C%20excluding%20all%20other%20%60text%5C/.*%60s%20\\(like%20%60/plain%60\\).,-Add%20Comment)\n\n> ~~~HTML\n> <h1 class=\"allcaps\">HTML</h1>\n> ~~~\n\nThis should be:\n\n> ~~~HTML\n> <h1 class=\"allcaps\"><abbr>HTML</abbr></h1>\n> ~~~\n\n...because HTML is an acronym of Hyper-Text Markup Language.",
